sentences.text:
Hence, the following:
ORDER i) Order passed in MVC No.1262/2017 dated 19.01.2021 by the Court of Senior Civil Judge and Addl. MACT, Sira is hereby confirmed and hence MFA No.1555/2021 and MFA Crob.No.63/2022 are hereby dismissed;
ii) Order passed in MVC No.1261/2017 is hereby modified and the compensation award is enhanced by an additional amount of Rs.50,000/- without any interest and hence, MFA No.1552/2021 is dismissed and MFA Crob.62/2022 are allowed in part;
iii) The respondent-APSRTC shall be liable to pay the compensation amount along with due interest thereon to the petitioners within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this order;
iv) Amount in deposit, if any, shall stand transferred to the concerned Tribunal for disbursement;
v) Draw modified award accordingly;
vi) Registry to return the records to the jurisdictional Tribunal forthwith.
